    </div>
  </section>
  <footer class="discovery-sources discovery-wrap">
    <p class="discovery-kicker">SOURCE & SCIENTIFIC LIMITS</p>
    <p>Based on Prylutskyi, O. &amp; Kapets, N. (2024), <i>State-of-the-Art of iNaturalist as a Source of Data on Ukrainian Fungi</i>, <i>Citizen Science: Theory and Practice</i>. The authors' data snapshot was June 1, 2024. The approximately 350 km figure describes the separation from the nearest previously documented comparison record, not a measured dispersal distance. This editorial adaptation does not independently verify the original observation or establish a present-day range boundary.</p>
    <p><a href="https://doi.org/10.5334/cstp.717" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Read the original study ↗</a> · <a href="https://github.com/olehprylutskyi/inaturalist_ua_paper" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Authors' data and analysis code ↗</a></p>
  </footer>
